    "Source is Canon JP2021-018277A ('Optical system and image pickup apparatus'), same patent family and application as p24.json (application JP2019-132360, filed 7/18/2019, published 2/15/2021, granted JP7293017B2). Machine-translated (Google Patents) English text; original Japanese.",
    "Numerical Example 3 of the same six-example application (Examples 1,4,5 are 24 mm; Example 2 is 35 mm F1.8; Example 6 is 50 mm F1.4). Example 3 is the only 28 mm example.",
    "No public source ties this example to a shipped product, so `representativeOf` is omitted. Canon has not (as of 9/28/2026) shipped an RF 28mm prime at this aperture class; this appears to be an unbuilt design from Canon's exploratory patent family.",
